Package: ipchecker
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: IP Inspector Pro
Depends: libqt6widgets6, libqt6network6, libqt6gui6, libqt6core6, libgl1, libc6
Description: IP Inspector Pro - Network IP Information Tool
 A Qt6-based application that displays local and public IP addresses,
 network interface details, MAC addresses, geolocation, and more.
 Features include dark/light themes, system tray integration, export
 functionality, and auto-refresh.
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/amg/ipchecker
